WEBVTT

01:01.960 --> 01:03.640
The fish soup is here.

01:04.680 --> 01:05.840
Sorry for the wait.

01:05.840 --> 01:07.100
Here is your fish soup.

01:07.480 --> 01:08.800
Let me serve you a bowl.

01:09.760 --> 01:11.020
We'll do it ourselves.

01:13.160 --> 01:14.090
Enjoy your meal.

01:44.400 --> 01:45.440
How attentive.

01:46.640 --> 01:47.800
Such a temper.

01:47.800 --> 01:49.060
Are you still mad at me?

01:54.640 --> 01:56.100
The fish soup is poisoned.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.680
Could it be Mother's men?

02:07.520 --> 02:08.960
It seems when we left the city gates,

02:08.960 --> 02:10.360
we were still suspected.

02:10.639 --> 02:11.700
The waiter is gone.

02:11.760 --> 02:12.960
He's not from the inn.

02:14.920 --> 02:16.650
Let's go back to the room first.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.250
Since you've already found out

02:38.520 --> 02:40.320
that the fish soup wasn't poisoned,

02:40.320 --> 02:42.180
and only Her Ladyship's bowl was,

02:43.000 --> 02:44.400
then the poisoner...

02:44.400 --> 02:45.400
can only be you.

02:45.760 --> 02:47.420
If I really wanted to kill her,

02:47.560 --> 02:49.560
why would I save her from danger so many times?

02:49.560 --> 02:52.960
Of course, it's for the ledger of the gold embezzlement case.

02:55.480 --> 02:57.920
You failed to steal the ledger in the palace,

02:57.920 --> 02:59.360
so you changed your identity,

02:59.360 --> 03:00.080
followed us all the way,

03:00.080 --> 03:01.810
and waited for an opportunity.

03:01.840 --> 03:02.920
I just don't know

03:03.160 --> 03:04.820
if you are General Shen's man,

03:05.760 --> 03:07.890
or if there's someone else behind you.

03:09.160 --> 03:10.240
Tell me.

03:10.240 --> 03:11.170
What's going on?

03:12.960 --> 03:13.760
Not again.

03:14.280 --> 03:16.920
It was indeed me who stole the ledger in the palace,

03:16.920 --> 03:18.720
but he was wrong about one thing.

03:19.160 --> 03:20.560
I am indeed your cousin.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.760
Otherwise,

03:22.760 --> 03:25.079
with General Shen's wise and suspicious nature,

03:25.079 --> 03:26.680
why would he trust me so much?

03:26.760 --> 03:28.200
I just don't understand

03:28.880 --> 03:31.160
why she would attack you.

03:31.200 --> 03:32.000
Mr. Zhao,

03:32.640 --> 03:34.170
don't dodge the main issue.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.100
Who do you really work for?

03:39.400 --> 03:40.860
Are you interrogating me?

03:43.000 --> 03:45.730
Since Mr. Zhao wants to travel with Her Highness,

03:47.040 --> 03:49.640
you should naturally treat us with sincerity.

03:51.600 --> 03:53.860
I have no hidden agenda in following you.

03:53.920 --> 03:56.180
My only purpose is to ensure your safety.

03:56.600 --> 03:57.600
Although

03:57.600 --> 03:59.200
I work for General Shen,

04:00.080 --> 04:01.610
I don't want you to get hurt.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.740
Even if you won't take my life,

04:04.880 --> 04:05.840
dare you say

04:06.440 --> 04:08.040
you haven't deceived me at all

04:08.040 --> 04:09.700
and have no ulterior motives?

04:11.120 --> 04:12.580
What motives could I have?

04:13.360 --> 04:14.800
I saved your lives.

04:14.800 --> 04:16.440
I paid for your expenses.

04:16.440 --> 04:17.899
And I did all the fighting.

04:20.680 --> 04:22.680
If I really have an ulterior motive,

04:25.560 --> 04:26.600
I would hope

04:27.280 --> 04:29.340
you could fall in love with me one day.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.570
Does that count as a motive?

04:42.280 --> 04:43.280
You

04:43.440 --> 04:44.900
shouldn't have saved her.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.680
She is an ungrateful wretch.

04:47.280 --> 04:49.520
She was just betrayed by her closest kin.

04:49.520 --> 04:51.840
It is right for her not to trust anyone.

04:52.920 --> 04:53.880
Yeah.

04:54.400 --> 04:56.280
You are so great.

04:56.520 --> 04:59.380
Not only do you save the sweetheart who stabbed you,

04:59.520 --> 05:02.200
but you also have to save your sweetheart's sweetheart.

05:02.200 --> 05:03.200
Shut your mouth.

05:23.080 --> 05:25.210
You like looking at me so much, cousin?

05:25.680 --> 05:26.480
Robbery!

05:29.280 --> 05:30.160
Robbery!

05:32.360 --> 05:34.200
Stop! Robbery!

05:34.560 --> 05:35.520
Put down your weapons

05:35.520 --> 05:36.480
and surrender!

05:36.840 --> 05:37.560
I advise you all

05:37.560 --> 05:38.560
to behave.

05:38.560 --> 05:40.600
Do you see my armor?

05:41.200 --> 05:43.840
I belong to the Northern Army.

05:43.840 --> 05:44.920
If you dare to make a move,

05:44.920 --> 05:46.050
we will kill you all.

05:46.440 --> 05:47.500
The Northern Army.

05:48.280 --> 05:49.540
Baili Jinghong's men.

05:57.280 --> 05:58.720
I wonder which general

05:58.920 --> 06:00.560
you serve under

06:00.560 --> 06:02.160
in the Northern Border Army.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.720
You wouldn't know even if I told you.

06:04.840 --> 06:06.200
The Jade-Faced Fierce General,

06:06.200 --> 06:07.880
Young General Jiuying.

06:07.880 --> 06:09.080
Have you heard of him?

06:18.040 --> 06:20.440
Top-grade cloud brocade. You must be rich.

06:21.320 --> 06:22.240
I advise you

06:22.240 --> 06:24.480
to hand over all your silver immediately.

06:24.480 --> 06:26.240
Otherwise... Humph.

06:37.120 --> 06:38.720
What did the Second Boss eat?

06:38.760 --> 06:40.159
The smell is too pungent.

06:42.560 --> 06:44.200
Take them away.

06:59.480 --> 07:00.760
The Second Boss is back.

07:00.760 --> 07:02.480
The Second Boss is back.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.280
Hurry, keep up.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.240
Behave.

07:05.240 --> 07:06.560
You rich people,

07:06.920 --> 07:08.880
let's see how I deal with you.

07:10.000 --> 07:10.800
Brother.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.160
Second Brother.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.020
Little sister.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.320
Look, Boss.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.920
I brought them back for you.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.440
This batch is all rich people.

07:18.440 --> 07:19.560
Brothers, uh,

07:19.560 --> 07:21.090
take off their blindfolds.

07:21.600 --> 07:23.860
Okay, let's see how these fat sheep look.

07:28.640 --> 07:29.640
Boss, take a look.

07:31.880 --> 07:32.720
How are they, Boss?

07:32.720 --> 07:33.680
Not bad, right?

07:35.520 --> 07:37.120
Yeah, this batch is not bad.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.080
Take them inside.

07:38.080 --> 07:38.840
Go.

07:39.360 --> 07:40.600
Take them all.

07:41.000 --> 07:41.760
Go.

07:44.720 --> 07:45.480
Hehe.

07:45.720 --> 07:46.760
Let me tell you, little sister.

07:46.760 --> 07:48.360
As soon as I showed up,

07:48.360 --> 07:49.320
the armor on my body,

07:49.320 --> 07:50.920
they had never seen it before.

07:50.920 --> 07:51.640
Really?

07:53.200 --> 07:55.240
I was so majestic.

07:56.280 --> 07:58.480
These weaklings from the city

07:58.480 --> 08:01.280
were almost paralyzed on the spot.

08:01.600 --> 08:02.840
You're really amazing, Second Brother.

08:02.840 --> 08:03.800
Let me tell you.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.930
These rich people have no experience.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.320
They only have money.

08:07.320 --> 08:08.920
We'll torture them well later. Mother.

08:08.920 --> 08:10.200
Who are they?

08:10.200 --> 08:12.720
Did the Boss rescue them too?

08:12.960 --> 08:14.600
Why are they tied up?

08:15.800 --> 08:17.760
Those brought back tied up are definitely not good people.

08:17.760 --> 08:18.820
Don't look at them.

08:19.120 --> 08:22.920
Careful, you might get beaten to death by them like your big brother.

08:24.880 --> 08:25.880
Hurry inside.

08:26.120 --> 08:26.600
Hurry.

08:27.640 --> 08:28.280
Get in.

08:28.320 --> 08:29.120
Hurry up.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.620
Where is your general?

08:46.600 --> 08:47.880
Behave and write a letter first.

08:47.880 --> 08:49.360
Have someone come to ransom you.

08:49.360 --> 08:50.760
If no one ransoms you,

08:50.880 --> 08:52.720
we'll skin you alive.

08:55.320 --> 08:59.000
I didn't expect the Northern Border Army to have such terrifying methods.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.840
I haven't heard of this before.

09:01.840 --> 09:02.640
Hmph.

09:03.400 --> 09:04.840
Have some water first.

09:05.080 --> 09:06.440
Oh, sister.

09:06.800 --> 09:07.800
They haven't even paid yet.

09:07.800 --> 09:09.730
Why are you being so polite to them?

09:22.480 --> 09:23.640
Second Boss.

09:23.640 --> 09:26.160
Please save my husband.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.440
Dr. Zheng said

09:27.640 --> 09:29.720
if we don't get money to buy medicine down the mountain,

09:29.720 --> 09:31.760
he won't survive for three days.

09:31.760 --> 09:33.120
Second Boss,

09:33.120 --> 09:34.760
Miss Doukou,

09:35.120 --> 09:37.440
please give me ten more copper coins to save his life.

09:37.440 --> 09:38.800
Get up.

09:39.160 --> 09:40.040
I beg you.

09:40.040 --> 09:41.320
Hurry, get up.

09:43.080 --> 09:44.800
My Huzi is still young.

09:44.800 --> 09:46.360
He can't live without a father.

09:46.360 --> 09:50.040
I kowtow to you. I beg you.

09:50.040 --> 09:52.200
Please.

09:53.080 --> 09:55.320
In pursuit of longevity,

09:55.320 --> 09:58.080
the late emperor spent thousands of taels of silver just to eat a fish.

09:58.080 --> 10:02.140
Escorting it all the way sacrificed many elite soldiers and fine horses.

10:02.440 --> 10:03.600
What a sorrowful world.

10:03.600 --> 10:05.840
I beg you, Second Boss.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.680
Come.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.800
Here, this is for you.

10:10.320 --> 10:11.880
Get up.

10:13.400 --> 10:14.720
It's not enough.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.960
Well, I don't have any more either.

10:23.800 --> 10:25.000
Thank you, Second Boss.

10:25.000 --> 10:27.680
Thank you, Miss Doukou.

10:27.880 --> 10:28.880
Go.

10:34.040 --> 10:35.240
Hero,

10:35.240 --> 10:37.360
aren't you under General Jiuying's command?

10:37.360 --> 10:38.840
So shabby.

10:39.360 --> 10:40.960
Giving so little money,

10:40.960 --> 10:42.720
it's not even enough for a dose of medicine.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.980
None of your business.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.040
Mind your own business.

10:45.040 --> 10:47.520
If no one comes to ransom you,

10:47.840 --> 10:49.400
I will slaughter you all.

10:50.280 --> 10:51.720
Do I still need to be ransomed?

10:51.720 --> 10:53.720
I can give you gold right now.

10:54.040 --> 10:54.960
What?

10:55.960 --> 10:57.280
You have gold on you?

11:00.080 --> 11:01.810
I don't have any on me right now.

11:01.920 --> 11:02.680
But,

11:03.160 --> 11:06.040
this mountain of yours actually has a

11:06.760 --> 11:07.600
gold mine.

11:07.640 --> 11:08.640
What?

11:08.640 --> 11:10.040
A gold mine?

11:11.560 --> 11:12.720
Hey, boss.

11:13.320 --> 11:16.320
This kid says there's a gold mine on our mountain.

11:16.400 --> 11:18.440
He's glib and looks like a gigolo.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.400
Can we trust his words?

11:19.400 --> 11:21.400
In our rundown Beimang Mountain,

11:21.400 --> 11:23.260
could there really be a gold mine?

11:23.320 --> 11:24.680
Don't you have the manpower?

11:24.680 --> 11:25.840
You might as well give it a try.

11:25.840 --> 11:27.080
Easy for you to say.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.560
We have plenty of manpower.

11:28.560 --> 11:30.760
But doesn't mining take a lot of effort?

11:31.040 --> 11:33.320
Dig. If there isn't any,

11:34.200 --> 11:36.200
I have plenty of strength and means.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.200
What if there is?

11:37.200 --> 11:38.240
Absolutely impossible.

11:38.240 --> 11:40.160
I think you're just afraid we'll kill you,

11:40.160 --> 11:42.020
and are making up lies to trick us.

11:42.720 --> 11:45.040
He has a delicate face.

11:45.040 --> 11:48.760
If we sell him to a male brothel,

11:49.680 --> 11:50.880
the people there

11:50.880 --> 11:53.280
will love a pretty boy like him.

11:56.640 --> 11:57.200
Brother.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.000
Look at this one, strong and sturdy.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.930
Let's keep him to do the hard labor.

12:04.520 --> 12:05.600
Well.

12:07.040 --> 12:09.700
Leave this scholar for Doukou to be her husband.

12:09.880 --> 12:12.640
He's the only one who looks like a good guy here.

12:13.680 --> 12:14.760
Hey, brother.

12:14.960 --> 12:16.490
What are you talking about?

12:17.520 --> 12:18.880
Hey, sister.

12:19.560 --> 12:20.960
Brother.

12:20.960 --> 12:23.820
She's been shy since she was little. Don't you know?

12:24.120 --> 12:26.560
Look at her. She's quite pretty.

12:26.720 --> 12:28.120
What if we

12:28.120 --> 12:30.920
sell her to the Hongxiu Brothel?

12:31.800 --> 12:33.860
We can definitely make a lot of money.

12:33.920 --> 12:34.960
If he does,

12:36.400 --> 12:37.200
whip him.

12:37.920 --> 12:39.000
You want to whip me?

12:39.240 --> 12:40.480
I'll lay it on the line today.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.560
If you can dig up a gold mine,

12:41.560 --> 12:44.220
I'll twist my head off for you to kick like a ball.

13:53.600 --> 13:54.640
Right here.

13:58.680 --> 14:00.680
Are you kidding us in the middle of the night?

14:00.680 --> 14:02.810
You aren't trying to run away, are you?

14:03.760 --> 14:05.200
The Second Boss has extraordinary skills.

14:05.200 --> 14:06.040
Where could I run?

14:06.040 --> 14:07.300
What are you afraid of?

14:08.120 --> 14:09.160
Glad you know your place.

14:09.160 --> 14:10.080
I'll untie you.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.660
You're playing dumb to take advantage of us.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.840
Are you crazy?

15:37.960 --> 15:39.490
It turned white instantly.

15:42.480 --> 15:44.400
I've seen hair turn white overnight,

15:44.400 --> 15:46.440
but never instantly like this.

15:49.520 --> 15:52.120
He threw up blood just from touching the stone.

15:52.200 --> 15:54.860
Could he be terminally ill and trying to scam us?

15:56.880 --> 15:58.280
The gold mine is right here.

15:58.280 --> 15:59.240
Start digging.

15:59.240 --> 16:00.000
Boy.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.480
Digging a mountain is no small task.

16:02.520 --> 16:03.640
If you dare lie to me,

16:03.640 --> 16:05.320
you'll walk into this stronghold

16:05.320 --> 16:06.560
and be carried out dead.

16:06.560 --> 16:07.820
Quick, go get someone.

16:08.040 --> 16:08.560
Yes.

16:20.280 --> 16:21.480
Let me.

16:22.720 --> 16:24.040
Alright, you do it.

16:34.480 --> 16:36.800
You're really strong, little sister.

16:37.680 --> 16:38.960
Your stronghold

16:38.960 --> 16:40.420
really is full of talents.

16:45.920 --> 16:47.080
Oh, Boss.

16:47.080 --> 16:49.360
Boss, look, there really is gold.

16:49.360 --> 16:51.240
This is real gold, look.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.780
Gold-finding technique.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.400
You're from the Helian clan.

16:58.800 --> 17:01.240
I hope you two chiefs can keep this a secret for me.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.040
Don't worry.

17:02.400 --> 17:03.920
We will keep our mouths shut.

17:03.920 --> 17:06.040
Benefactor, I insulted you just now.

17:06.040 --> 17:08.700
I'll twist my head off for you to kick like a ball.

17:09.760 --> 17:10.560
Just kidding.

17:11.079 --> 17:12.040
Wouldn't a bloody head

17:12.040 --> 17:13.920
be creepy to kick?

17:21.160 --> 17:22.490
The poison is acting up.

17:27.480 --> 17:29.360
Boss, we're rich.

17:29.360 --> 17:30.800
Haha.
